Subject: [PATCH] Add optimal-route search script over target mass and beam
 energy

scripts/optimal_route.py runs isotopia_py for every library target with
mass number A_DI..A_DI+5 on a linear energy grid and ranks routes by DI
activity at end of cooling. Eback for charged particles follows from a
fixed target thickness via the code's Bethe-Bloch stopping power. An
exclusion file drops routes whose target or one-step decay precursor of
the DI is listed. tests/test_optimal_route.py covers name parsing, the
exclusion rules, the Eback solver (analytic S = k/E case) and a Mo-100
run with the library.

